{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1669","text":"「待って、保存しないで」までがセリフ。選択中の吹き出しには、その言葉をそのまま入れてほしい。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"text","value":"待って、保存しないで"},"group":"v03_extra_dev_quoted_value_then_reference","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"引用の終端を先に示し、その引用を本文として指定。保存禁止は本文内であり操作制約ではない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1670","text":"この吹き出しはしっぽなしで確定。しっぽを付ける案は採らず、その状態に設定して。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"tail_enabled","value":false},"group":"v03_extra_dev_settled_tail_state","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"希望する最終状態を先に確定し、採らない案を明示。しっぽ無効化だけの依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1671","text":"二十ミリにしたいのは、この吹き出しの高さだけなんだ。そこだけ変えてくれる？","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"bbox","value":{"height_mm":20}},"group":"v03_extra_dev_focused_dimension_value","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"値を前置して高さだけに焦点を当てる構文。対象と寸法は一意で他の変更は含まない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1672","text":"選んでいる吹き出し、コマの外にはみ出たところまで見せる設定をお願い。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"clip_to_panel","value":false},"group":"v03_extra_dev_visible_overflow_explanation","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_dev","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"はみ出し部分を見せるという説明で切取り無効を指定。形状や位置は変更しない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1673","text":"上へずらすんじゃなくて、下へ三ミリね。今選んでいる吹き出しを、そのぶん移して。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"bbox","value":{"dy_mm":3}},"group":"v03_extra_test_corrected_direction_before_target","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"否定した上方向を除外し、先に提示した下方向三ミリだけを参照して移動。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1674","text":"セリフを直すんじゃなくて、誰の発言にするかの修正ね。選択中の吹き出しは、美咲さんの発言として設定して。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"speaker","value":"美咲さん"},"group":"v03_extra_test_speaker_field_scope","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"本文編集を否定し、話者欄の変更を説明したうえで人物を指定。敬称を保持。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1675","text":"いま選択している吹き出しのセリフ、最初から言うね。この一文に丸ごと入れ替えてほしい。「それでも、ここに残る。」","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"text","value":"それでも、ここに残る。"},"group":"v03_extra_test_instruction_before_full_quote","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"全文置換を先に依頼し、後置された引用文を完成した本文として指定。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1676","text":"選択中の吹き出しは、左上が横十二ミリ、縦十八ミリに来るよう配置して。これは移動量じゃなくて、座標の指定ね。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"bbox","value":{"x_mm":12,"y_mm":18}},"group":"v03_extra_test_absolute_position_with_disambiguation","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"絶対座標を後続説明で移動差分から区別。xとyは一つのBBox操作。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1677","text":"コマ枠で切り取る設定を、今の吹き出しに適用して。輪郭を手で描き直す話じゃないよ。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"clip_to_panel","value":true},"group":"v03_extra_test_named_clipping_operation","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"適用する設定を先に提示し、対象を後置。輪郭の描き直しは否定し切取り有効だけを依頼。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1678","text":"縦十五ミリ、横二十七ミリの大きさでお願い。いま選んでいる吹き出しを、この寸法に合わせて。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"bbox","value":{"height_mm":15,"width_mm":27}},"group":"v03_extra_test_paired_dimensions_before_target","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"幅と高さを一組の寸法として先に提示し、後続文で既存対象への反映を依頼。単一BBox変更。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1679","text":"この吹き出しには「戻して」じゃなく「待って」を入れて。取り消しの操作を頼んでいるわけじゃないよ。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"text","value":"待って"},"group":"v03_extra_test_quoted_replacement_contrast","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"引用された旧案と新本文を対比。Undoは明示的に否定し本文置換だけを肯定。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
{"id":"nyamuru_voice_1680","text":"話しているのは由紀ちゃんだったね。いま選択している吹き出しを、その子に話者として割り当て直して。","label":"bubble_set","slots":{"target":"selected_bubble","field":"speaker","value":"由紀ちゃん"},"group":"v03_extra_test_speaker_antecedent_then_assignment","tags":["synthetic_evaluation","new_test","contract_only_authoring","replacement_candidate"],"note":"同一発話内で人物を述べ、その人物への話者設定を明示依頼。独立した人物判断は要求しない。","source":"codex_synthetic","review_status":"pending_user_review"}
